     1,
     "<font face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"3\">Dear all,</font><div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,65,81);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">    </span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,65,81);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">    Is the default definition of the number of nocturnal sleep episodes in GGIR based on sleep episodes lasting at least 5 minutes, separated by at least 5 seconds of wakefulness within the SPT-window?</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,65,81);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">     I&#39;ve come across studies where the criterion of &#39;5 seconds of wakefulness&#39; was adjusted to &#39;5 minutes of wakefulness.&#39; I&#39;m interested in understanding how to set parameters in GGIR to specifically obtain the &#39;number of sleep episodes of at least 5 minutes separated by at least 5 minutes of wakefulness within the SPT-window.&#39; </span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,65,81);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">      Your guidance on configuring these parameters would be greatly appreciated. Thank you.</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,65,81);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,65,81);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Best regards, </span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,65,81);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(55,65,81);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Margaret</span></div><div><br></div>"
